//- The highlight list on the home (§S11.3, `blog.highlight_tag`): the
//- titles of the newest four posts whose frontmatter `tags` contain the
//- tag, on a coral band; the heading is the tag itself. No link to the tag
//- page (its URL is plugin data). Not rendered when no post has the tag.
if themeUmwege.highlightPosts(pageLang({ meta })).length
    section.home-highlight
        div
            h2= themeUmwege.highlightTag()
            ul
                each item in themeUmwege.highlightPosts(pageLang({ meta }))
                    li
                        a(href=item.meta.href)= item.meta.title
